  "body": "Searching for architecturally designed space, sunshine, and top-tier schooling?\r\nYou are just a short walk to Macleans College, Macleans Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate (BBI), and local beaches. Location truly does not get better than this!\r\n\r\nArchitectural Elegance & Dual Living Spaces Features 5 double bedrooms and 2 distinct living areas-offering complete versatility for large families, multi-generational living, guests, or working from home.\r\n\r\nModern Designer Kitchen: A true chef’s dream featuring sleek modern finishes, top-quality fittings, and superior craftsmanship.\r\n\r\n3 Full Bathrooms: Thoughtfully designed with 3 full, beautifully appointed bathrooms (including a private master ensuite) to eliminate the morning rush!\r\n\r\nSecure Garage & Extra Parking: Internal access garage with extra storage space, plus a dedicated extra off-street car park.\r\n\r\nQuality & Comfort: Built with precision craftsmanship and high-end finishes throughout, complemented by a pre-installed heat pump for year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nFreehold Freedom – Total Independence! Enjoy total peace of mind with absolute Freehold title ownership-Enjoy complete control over your own quality property.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Convenience at Your Doorstep Beyond the world-class school zones, you’ll love the vibrant lifestyle on offer. Enjoy fast access to Highland Park Shopping Centre, Howick Village, Half Moon Bay Marina, beautiful local beaches, and easy public transport links.\r\n\r\nProperties offering this high level of architectural design, 2 living areas, 3 full bathrooms, top school zones, and fee-free freehold ownership are exceptionally rare. This is a must-see!\r\n\r\nCall us today to secure your private viewing!",
